<title>UK: Uruguay prices $100 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Uruguay prices $100 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager C.S. First Boston, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   URUGUAY</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     8.375     MATURITY    26.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.573    PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  75 BP     REOFFER    99.573    SPREAD	+160 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB+	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT JULY 2006 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	144 A ELIGIBLE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
